	(text
		""
		(at 20 21.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36779ed1-a748-5e58-8a8a-90eedb391c21")
	)
	(text
		"J1 JST XH S2B-XH-A: pin1 VIN_12V_RAW, pin2 GND. Mate with XHP-2 housing.  Pin 1 is the +12 V pin."
		(at 20 25.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "499ca137-7450-5821-bc1b-6da355780674")
	)
	(text
		"F1 1.5 A hold PPTC, then Q1 AO3401A P-FET (30 V Vds, 12 V Vgs max, 4 A) reverse-polarity switch (body diode to start, Vgs clamped to -5.1 V by D_QG)."
		(at 20 28.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fd7b1de4-a29d-5ac2-80df-e771513c69ea")
	)
	(text
		"Q1 gate check: the 5.1 V zener D_QG across source and gate limits Vgs to about 5.1 V, within the AO3401A 12 V gate-source rating. The drain sees at most the TVS clamp of 21.5 V (D_TVS is upstream of Q1), below the AO3401A 30 V drain-source rating by 8.5 V."
		(at 20 30.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ec1a8f78-fbe6-5440-bd34-de34d26f96ce")
	)
	(text
		"D_TVS SMAJ13A (Littelfuse, 400 W, VR 13.0 V, VBR 14.40 to 15.90 V at 1 mA, IR 1 uA maximum at VR, VC 21.5 V at IPP 18.6 A) sits on VIN_FUSED, before Q1: its cathode joins the fused input net on the Q1 drain side and its anode is on GND, so a surge is clamped before it reaches Q1, the buck or any capacitor. A reversed supply forward-biases D_TVS, which conducts and opens F1; Q1 then isolates the protected rail."
		(at 20 33.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2f2d7e2f-33bc-56a3-a237-605ec3042d37")
	)
	(text
		"TVS check: the supply is 12 V +/-5 % (10.8 to 12.6 V in operation), 0.4 V (3.2 %) below the 13.0 V standoff VR; at 13.0 V, the upper bound the checks use, leakage is the datasheet IR of 1 uA maximum and 13.0 V is 1.4 V below the 14.40 V minimum breakdown. Surge requirement: a source with impedance R_s keeps the TVS current at or below its rated 18.6 A (10/1000 us) while the open-circuit surge is at most 21.5 V + 18.6 A x R_s, which is 40.1 V at 1 ohm and 58.7 V at 2 ohm; at that current the TVS holds the rail at 21.5 V. Worst-case clamp 21.5 V is below the MP2307 recommended input maximum 23 V by 1.5 V and its absolute maximum 26 V by 4.5 V, below the AO3401A 30 V Vds by 8.5 V, and below the 25 V rating of C_BULK, C_IN1, C_IN2 and C_N7 by 3.5 V."
		(at 20 35.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5c4135fa-aa91-5c71-8d21-7114d25ccdac")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 38.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "36b860c1-61fe-51a5-85f5-1b85852bbb76")
	)
	(text
		"MP2307 (internal sync rectifier, 340 kHz). Vout = 0.925 V x (1 + 26.1k/10k) = 3.34 V."
		(at 20 42.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d37cbe37-968a-531a-a42c-35acb7e65519")
	)
	(text
		"L1 10 uH: ripple about 0.7 A p-p at 12 V in; confirm L1 saturation current against its datasheet."
		(at 20 44.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "47c4bf2a-da83-5d8d-965f-3a9eded9d37c")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 47.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ff78f978-30ec-53a8-b4a7-740691afb062")
	)
	(text
		"J_SWD pin1 +3V3, pin2 SWDIO, pin3 GND, pin4 SWCLK, pin5 NRST. No USB bootloader; program over SWD."
		(at 20 51.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "42d77c7d-4aa2-5664-a6b3-4de15bb53102")
	)
	(text
		"HSE 8 MHz on PC14/PC15 (OSC_IN/OSC_OUT). Crystal JYJE 3TJ480000FYLBC (LCSC C2924620), CL 8 pF, ESR 150 ohm max, C0 5 pF max. CL = (C1 x C2)/(C1 + C2) + Cstray with Cstray 5 pF, so C1 = C2 = 2 x (8 - 5) = 6 pF. Nearest standard value (E24) 6.2 pF: CL = 6.2/2 + 5 = 8.1 pF, 0.1 pF from 8 pF (limit 0.5 pF). Cstray 5 pF is an assumption, not measured."
		(at 20 53.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ee981824-d33d-57da-933c-6052f9c9f9c0")
	)
	(text
		"Boot: PA14 (SWCLK) is BOOT0; default option bytes boot from flash."
		(at 20 56.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5f1934d4-023e-5de3-a1e3-b1e6be6ef16e")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 59.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4f140c0-16a3-5f24-a60f-5eb2a0617aee")
	)
	(text
		"J_VALVE1 pin1 +12V_VALVE, pin2 VALVE1_SW (low-side). Flyback cathode to +12V_VALVE."
		(at 20 63.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "887ed772-5435-56f6-83e4-a83ca3a124c2")
	)
	(text
		"Load: 12 V DC solenoid, coil current at most 0.5 A. AO3400A carries 0.5 A (rated far above, needs datasheet value sourcing for the exact figure), flyback diode 1N5819-class (1 A class), VALVE1_SW is class PWR12 (0.8 mm, about 8x the width a 0.5 A / 10 C rise needs)."
		(at 20 65.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ed8cc4e5-4e36-5ca7-a4f1-b040e3adf36b")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 68.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "afc54e26-efe2-591a-b9c9-78d67d48f744")
	)
	(text
		"J_VALVE2 pin1 +12V_VALVE, pin2 VALVE2_SW (low-side). Flyback cathode to +12V_VALVE."
		(at 20 72.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5bab5842-5b5f-5fae-8ede-bded68676e05")
	)
	(text
		"Load: 12 V DC solenoid, coil current at most 0.5 A. Same checks as valve 1: MOSFET, flyback diode and PWR12 tracks carry 0.5 A."
		(at 20 74.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "392a3089-d212-5289-9cef-780893a7b8c0")
	)
	(text
		"R_SN2 100 ohm in series with C_SN2 10 nF is an RC snubber across the valve 2 coil connector. TP_V2 probes VALVE2_SW. C_B3 100 nF bypasses +12V_VALVE beside the valve 2 driver; R_B3 47 k bleeds the 12 V rail: 13.0 V / 47 k = 0.277 mA, 3.6 mW."
		(at 20 77.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "180d1e6b-d92b-5ba3-8b7b-82e309b8ccaa")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 79.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1bae70dc-c60a-549b-ab18-759100eee380")
	)
	(text
		"J_SOIL1 pin1 excitation, pin2 sense, pin3 GND. Probe between pins 1 and 2. Excitation off by default (gate pulled to +3V3)."
		(at 20 83.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "20adf34f-bc22-581d-9de3-6d7efe63e4da")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 86.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "204678eb-4dd1-5635-b988-2dd7fe54aa64")
	)
	(text
		"J_SOIL2 pin1 excitation, pin2 sense, pin3 GND. Probe between pins 1 and 2. Excitation off by default (gate pulled to +3V3)."
		(at 20 90.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "79e62dea-88b1-58bf-8104-f5320b4c042d")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 92.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89c21f0f-2e11-50de-a187-41a76a72bf61")
	)
	(text
		"J_FLOW pin1 +12V_VALVE sensor supply, pin2 GND, pin3 pulse. Open-collector assumed; 3.3 V zener D_FZ (cathode on FLOW_PULSE, anode on GND) behind R_FS 2.2 k clamps a push-pull output to the STM32G030 input range. Current at a 13.0 V sensor output: (13.0 - 3.3) / 2.2 k = 4.41 mA (12 V: 3.95 mA), about 3.3 V x 4.41 mA = 14.5 mW in the zener, far below a 500 mW SOD-123 zener class rating (exact rating needs datasheet sourcing). With the line open the 10 k pull-up R_FPU on +3V3 holds it at 3.3 V, so R_FPU adds at most 3.3 V / 10 k = 0.33 mA."
		(at 20 96.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "70af45ea-a447-5175-a39c-53ac77d35fdc")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 99.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7119d35f-4f8b-5564-89a3-bca284fd7a77")
	)
	(text
		"Addresses: APDS-9301 0x29 (ADR_SEL low), 24LC256 0x50 (A2..A0 low). No collisions. An SHT30 breakout attaches to J_I2C at address 0x44, which stays free."
		(at 20 103.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "53671dd8-dc60-530c-ada5-545402623ec0")
	)
	(text
		"J_I2C pin1 GND, pin2 +3V3, pin3 SDA, pin4 SCL. 3.3 V only, no 5 V; external load <= 100 mA."
		(at 20 105.91 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4b376ace-b1a7-53a2-9acb-41577ae94bc7")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 108.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7d11b848-25dd-5c74-85df-9202f16cde6d")
	)
	(text
		"D_PWR lit when +3V3 is present. D_VALVE lit when firmware commands either valve on."
		(at 20 112.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0467411e-138b-5095-b531-f1756de1643b")
	)
	(text
		"D_N1 lit when +12V_VALVE is present (R_N3), D_N2 lit when +3V3 is present (R_N4)."
		(at 20 114.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d062bef-bfe1-5ac0-9363-aaeef76ef80c")
	)
	(text
		"LED currents are I = (V - Vf) / R, with Vf from the LED datasheets: Lite-On LTST-C190KGKT 1.9 to 2.4 V at 20 mA (green LEDs D_PWR and D_N2), KENTO KT-0603Y 2.4 V (amber LEDs D_VALVE and D_N1, from its LCSC listing). D_PWR, R_PWR 680 and D_N2, R_N4 680 on +3V3: 1.3 to 2.1 mA, at most 4.85 mA with Vf = 0. D_VALVE, R_LV 680, driven from MCU pin PA7 at 3.3 V: 1.3 mA, at most 4.85 mA with Vf = 0; the STM32G030 datasheet (DS12991, Table 19) limits the current sourced by any I/O pin to 15 mA. D_N1, R_N3 2.2 k on +12V_VALVE: (13.0 V - 2.4 V) / 2.2 k = 4.8 mA, 51 mW in R_N3, and at most 13.0 V / 2.2 k = 5.9 mA, 77 mW with Vf = 0, against the 100 mW of the 0603 UNI-ROYAL 0603WAF resistor."
		(at 20 117.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7f48a25f-bcde-553a-bd90-3ca6288c6945")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 120.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1d921918-7fba-510d-98f9-4d781a6debb9")
	)
	(text
		"+3V3 bulk and high-frequency decoupling; R_N1 and R_N2 are bleeders across +3V3."
		(at 20 124.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23b8039d-6fab-58a7-8ec1-92cc7fbe3d07")
	)
	(text
		"C_B8 4.7 uF adds bulk decoupling to +3V3 beside the MCU. C_B2 and C_B4 100 nF plus C_B5 4.7 uF add high-frequency and bulk decoupling to +3V3 near the I2C parts. R_B2 100 k and R_B4 47 k are bleeders across +3V3 (3.3 V / 100 k = 33 uA and 3.3 V / 47 k = 70 uA); R_N1 100 k and R_N2 47 k give the same 33 uA and 70 uA, so the four bleeders draw 206 uA in total, 0.68 mW. TP_SDA and TP_SCL probe the I2C bus."
		(at 20 126.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "47e8a966-eedd-5fbe-a9ee-2d89eb1d5081")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 129.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8d6d3605-2e29-58e4-9b6f-4d9b733da1d4")
	)
	(text
		"+12V_VALVE decoupling and bleeders."
		(at 20 133.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2dff3be1-8e1e-5186-be34-2b9c0f45ee60")
	)
	(text
		"R_B1 bleeds C_BULK (100 k, 13.0 V / 100 k = 0.130 mA). R_N5 and R_N6 are 100 k bleeders on the same rail, 0.130 mA each. Resistive bleed of the +12V_VALVE rail: R_N5, R_N6, R_B1 (100 k each) and R_B3 (47 k) in parallel are 19.5 k, 0.67 mA at 13.0 V; with R_EN 100 k to the buck enable 16.3 k. C_BULK 100 uF plus about 30 uF of other capacitance on the rail (C_IN1, C_IN2 10 uF each, C_N7 10 uF, small 100 nF parts) is about 130 uF, so the time constant is 16.3 k x 130 uF = 2.1 s and the rail is below 5 % (3 tau) in about 6 s, ignoring the faster discharge through the buck, LED and valve loads. C_B1 is 100 nF high-frequency bypass on +12V_VALVE. R_SN1 100 ohm in series with C_SN1 10 nF is an RC snubber across the valve 1 coil connector. TP_V1 is a test point on VALVE1_SW."
		(at 20 135.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "102f2394-e8d1-5718-acb6-b048bafe6f19")
	)
	(text
		""
		(at 20 138.23 0)
